  start --> prepare
  start --> contract
  start --> iterate
  scripts -.->|default script| prepare
  iterate --> seed
  seed --> changed
  iterate --> preamble
  iterate -->|creates| run
  iterate --> await
  await --> judge
  judge --> judgeit
  judgeit --> record
  judge -->|unmet| iterate
  judge -->|met, checks set| gate
  judge -->|met, no checks| tick
  gate --> checks
  gate -->|a check failed| iterate
  gate -->|all pass| tick
  answer -->|new run| iterate

